   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "raw  fp32 · 2560 dim                    400 GB   ✗ never\nMRL  1024 · fp16, on_disk               80 GB   disk (gp3)\nint8 quantized, always_ram               40 GB   RAM\nHNSW links ≈ 150 B / vector               6 GB   RAM\npayload + keyword indexes                 8 GB   RAM\n× replication factor 2                  108 GB   RAM total\n\n→ 4 × r6i.2xlarge (64 GB): 27 GB each, 58 % headroom\n\nnext rung (100M+): binary quantization (32×), hot/cold\nshard placement by query volume, ef 64 → 48 after benchmark",
   "originalText": "raw  fp32 · 2560 dim                    400 GB   ✗ never\nMRL  1024 · fp16, on_disk               80 GB   disk (gp3)\nint8 quantized, always_ram               40 GB   RAM\nHNSW links ≈ 150 B / vector               6 GB   RAM\npayload + keyword indexes                 8 GB   RAM\n× replication factor 2                  108 GB   RAM total\n\n→ 4 × r6i.2xlarge (64 GB): 27 GB each, 58 % headroom\n\nnext rung (100M+): binary quantization (32×), hot/cold\nshard placement by query volume, ef 64 → 48 after benchmark",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
