   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "key                                                 ttl                    expected hit\nretr:{ticker}:{query_sha}:{filters_sha}:{coll_ver}  until new accession    70–90 %  section-templated queries\nevid:sec:{ticker}:{accession}                       until new accession    ~100 %\nevid:news:{ticker}:{bucket_15m}                     15 min                 50–70 %\nevid:market:{ticker}:{bucket_15m}                   15 min (60 s raw)      50–70 %\nmemo:{snapshot_hash}:{prompt_version}:{model}       snapshot validity      30–60 % hot tickers · ~0 % tail\nemb:chunk:{content_sha}                             ∞  (ingest side)       ~95 % on amendments / re-ingest\nemb:q:{sha(text)}  + semantic cos ≥ 0.98            24 h                   40–60 %\n\nFORBIDDEN   memo lookup by query similarity across snapshots — financial content is time-sensitive\nevery cache exposes hit/miss counters in /metrics; every key carries coll_ver or snapshot_hash",
   "originalText": "key                                                 ttl                    expected hit\nretr:{ticker}:{query_sha}:{filters_sha}:{coll_ver}  until new accession    70–90 %  section-templated queries\nevid:sec:{ticker}:{accession}                       until new accession    ~100 %\nevid:news:{ticker}:{bucket_15m}                     15 min                 50–70 %\nevid:market:{ticker}:{bucket_15m}                   15 min (60 s raw)      50–70 %\nmemo:{snapshot_hash}:{prompt_version}:{model}       snapshot validity      30–60 % hot tickers · ~0 % tail\nemb:chunk:{content_sha}                             ∞  (ingest side)       ~95 % on amendments / re-ingest\nemb:q:{sha(text)}  + semantic cos ≥ 0.98            24 h                   40–60 %\n\nFORBIDDEN   memo lookup by query similarity across snapshots — financial content is time-sensitive\nevery cache exposes hit/miss counters in /metrics; every key carries coll_ver or snapshot_hash",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n_cache",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
