   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "on open:  Bedrock  →  Azure OpenAI  →  vLLM warm pool  →  MemoCache (stale-flagged, status degraded)\nnever a 500 while a snapshot exists. Tenant TPM bucket in Redis; exhausted → 429 + Retry-After.\nqueue depth is the backpressure signal, not a buffer to hide in.",
   "originalText": "on open:  Bedrock  →  Azure OpenAI  →  vLLM warm pool  →  MemoCache (stale-flagged, status degraded)\nnever a 500 while a snapshot exists. Tenant TPM bucket in Redis; exhausted → 429 + Retry-After.\nqueue depth is the backpressure signal, not a buffer to hide in.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
