   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Parity suites assert identical behaviour across implementations before a flag flips:\n  Reranker:        TEI service  vs  in-process CrossEncoder      (same top-k on the benchmark)\n  LLMProvider:     Bedrock  vs  Azure OpenAI  vs  vLLM           (same prompt_version, judge κ ≥ 0.85)\n  RetrievalCache:  Redis  vs  in-memory                          (same packets, same TTL semantics)\n  RetrievalStore:  Qdrant  vs  Chroma (fallback)                 (same filter semantics — existing suite)",
   "originalText": "Parity suites assert identical behaviour across implementations before a flag flips:\n  Reranker:        TEI service  vs  in-process CrossEncoder      (same top-k on the benchmark)\n  LLMProvider:     Bedrock  vs  Azure OpenAI  vs  vLLM           (same prompt_version, judge κ ≥ 0.85)\n  RetrievalCache:  Redis  vs  in-memory                          (same packets, same TTL semantics)\n  RetrievalStore:  Qdrant  vs  Chroma (fallback)                 (same filter semantics — existing suite)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
